p01 : 222.41
p03 : 9.21
p04 : 61.44
p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 7'3"A (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 78.1 L)
p97 : This is my enlarged version of the 6’9”A fish blank. I designed this one as to be able to easily net a 7’3” by the bottom measurement. Bottom rocker is a longer version of the natural rocker of the 6’9”A I made in 2002. I basically “blew up” the 6’9”A concept for this mold design. This blank can be ordered wider or narrower as to allow for stronger decks/rails near the perimeter of the board outline, and less waste.
